lthy and the error rate is 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again and found it had been created, so there's only one and the on-call engineer was paged once.\n- INC-0001 covers what failed, the partial rollback and retry, and the current state. It lists two follow-ups:\n  - Find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure. Its release candidate, v2.3.1-rc, was also unhealthy.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}